  "content": "<p>這個模組在海洋中添加了一艘<strong>巨型掠奪者戰艦</strong>，裝滿了戰利品和貴重物品。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/264/illager-warship.png\" width=\"385\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/267/loot.png\" width=\"385\"></p><ul>\n<li><strong>生成位置：</strong>這艘船會出現在所有<strong>海洋生態域</strong>中。</li>\n<li><strong>掠奪者船員：</strong>戰艦由各種掠奪者守衛，他們保護船上的寶藏。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/269/side-view.png\" width=\"385\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/268/rooms.png\" width=\"385\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>歡迎在您的模組包中使用此模組</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">也請查看村民戰艦模組：</p><p><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/92/ship.png\" width=\"385\" height=\"217\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a style=\"color:#236fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-warship\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-warship</a></span></p><hr><p>特別感謝 SirBlake</p>",
